    "description": {
      "content": "API for Zencoder. Zencoder offers a fast and reliable transcoding service for video and audio files, as well as live streams. It can produce outputs for the web and a wide variety of devices, and can easily be integrated with your CMS and other applications.\n\n**Base URL: https://app.zencoder.com/api/v2**",
